-- W2F-B: one ROADMAP-1 issue per reader family of the 32 retired or folded worker directories that archive/MANIFEST.md holds back (RM-REPO-DEAD-SOURCES-1, charter pillar core, 2026-11-05).
-- REPO-ARCHIVE-NEXT-1 (agent_issues 1002079) promised "one issue per reader family"; this file files them. Evidence was read on origin/main on 2026-11-05 (archive/MANIFEST.md, section "Not moved yet").
--   ARCHIVE-READERS-1  fold-parity suites in the hosts read ../<name>/worker.js and ../<name>/FOLDED (15 suites, 12 members)
--   ARCHIVE-READERS-2  workflow steps run <name>/<suite> or name the path (deploy-gate, pr-checks, version-compare, version-bump-guard, backlog-exec-test, apply-unmangle, codeql) and run-suites CONTROL_PLANE
--   ARCHIVE-READERS-3  guard scripts and path-reading tests (mirror-guard, dup-worker-name-gate, deploy-drift-guard, cron_rate_guard, canary_revert, charter.test, ai-attribution-*)
-- PREDICTION: no metric moves from this file; each issue's definition of done lowers worker_live_audit NOT_DEPLOYED by the directories it frees.
-- APPLY-BY: ci
-- DB: qnfo-audit
-- Rollback: DELETE FROM agent_issues WHERE (title LIKE 'ROADMAP-1: QNFO.INFRA ARCHIVE-READERS-1:%' OR title LIKE 'ROADMAP-1: QNFO.INFRA ARCHIVE-READERS-2:%' OR title LIKE 'ROADMAP-1: QNFO.INFRA ARCHIVE-READERS-3:%') AND status = 'open';
-- CAUSE-MAPPED: registers no metric.
-- spof-review: adds no worker, cron, D1 trigger, route or credential; it writes three issue rows.

INSERT INTO agent_issues (title, description, source, category, priority, status, created_at, updated_at)
SELECT 'ROADMAP-1: QNFO.INFRA ARCHIVE-READERS-1: fold-parity suites read the FOLDED member under archive/<name>/ so twelve held-back members can move (RM-REPO-DEAD-SOURCES-1)',
 'session-task: repo=qnfo-workers path=qnfo-research-exec/reviser-fold.test.mjs' || char(10) ||
 'edit-near: const guest = readFileSync(new URL("../qnfo-paper-reviser/worker.js", import.meta.url), "utf8");' || char(10) ||
 'code-probe: {"paths": ["qnfo-research-exec/reviser-fold.test.mjs"], "contains": "../archive/qnfo-paper-reviser/worker.js"}' || char(10) || char(10) ||
 'Charter pillar core (program QNFO.INFRA); roadmap row RM-REPO-DEAD-SOURCES-1 (21); follows agent_issues 1002079. Metric it should move: worker_live_audit NOT_DEPLOYED rows, minus the members moved.' || char(10) ||
 'Evidence (archive/MANIFEST.md, section Not moved yet, first row): a suite of a host directory proves the FOLDED member is line-identical to the code embedded in its host by reading ../<member>/worker.js and ../<member>/FOLDED. The suites: qnfo-ai-calibration/prober-fold.test.mjs (ai-health-prober), qnfo-ai-calibration/qnfo-evolve-fold.test.mjs (qnfo-evolve), qnfo-research-exec/errata-fold.test.mjs and ground.test.mjs (errata-hub, qnfo-errata-respond, qnfo-errata-watch, qnfo-paper-reviser), qnfo-research-exec/reviser-fold.test.mjs and reviser-ai-thinking.test.mjs (qnfo-paper-reviser), qnfo-lifecycle/paper-learn-anchor.test.mjs, backlog-fold.test.mjs, backlog-latest-pass.test.mjs, close-refusal.test.mjs and sla-gap.test.mjs (errata-hub, qnfo-backlog-exec, qnfo-archive), qnfo-code-orchestrator/fleet-exec-fold.test.mjs (fleet-exec), qnfo-observability/scorer-fold.test.mjs (qnfo-autonomy-scorer), qnfo-cloud-ops/email-orch-fold.test.mjs (qnfo-email-orchestrator), qnfo-infra/indexer-fold.test.mjs (qnfo-paper-indexer), qnfo-email/unsub-link.test.mjs (qnfo-outreach). Moving a member before its suite changes would turn the full-set suites red.' || char(10) ||
 'DO (one pull request per host, claims first; qnfo-code-orchestrator and qnfo-observability are control-plane and go through the stale-PR lane): in each suite replace ../<member>/ with ../archive/<member>/ (the comparison and the marker read stay, only the path changes), run the suite, then git mv the member to archive/<member>/ with its row in archive/MANIFEST.md and regenerate docs/INDEX.md and docs/agent-catalog.json (node scripts/build-agent-catalog.mjs); check the full set with a dispatched deploy-gate run, because the push runs on main are cancelled by bursts.' || char(10) ||
 'Definition of done: the twelve members named in the manifest row are under archive/, every suite above passes at the new path, a dispatched deploy-gate run on the branch has no failing suite from this change, worker_live_audit NOT_DEPLOYED reads twelve lower than before; recorded in issue_triage.close_evidence.',
 'session:w2f-b', 'optimization', 'low', 'open', CAST(strftime('%s', 'now') AS INTEGER) * 1000, CAST(strftime('%s', 'now') AS INTEGER) * 1000
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM agent_issues WHERE title LIKE 'ROADMAP-1: QNFO.INFRA ARCHIVE-READERS-1:%' AND status = 'open');

